#!/bin/sh
# Run TypeScript type-check across all packages before push
# This prevents type errors from being pushed to the remote
echo "Running TypeScript type check..."
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json

# Check exit code
if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then
  echo ""
  echo "TypeScript type check failed. Fix the errors above before pushing."
  exit 1
fi

echo "Type check passed!"
